---
import SiteLayout from '../layouts/SiteLayout.astro'
import SiteHeader from '../components/SiteHeader.astro'
import { site } from '../data/site'
---
<SiteLayout title="Start a Digital Product Project | Contact Twin Tech-sudo" description="Discuss a custom software, web, mobile, desktop, website, e-commerce or AI product with the Twin Tech-sudo digital studio.">
  <SiteHeader /><main class="contact-page"><section><span class="page-kicker">// START A PROJECT</span><h1>Bring the difficult<br /><em>idea.</em></h1><p>Tell us what you want to make possible, who it needs to help and where you are in the journey. You do not need a finished specification.</p><p><a href="/work/">Explore selected studio work →</a></p>{site.email && <div class="contact-direct"><span>Prefer email?</span><a href={`mailto:${site.email}?subject=Project enquiry for Twin Tech-sudo`}>{site.email} ↗</a><small>United Kingdom · working nationwide</small></div>}</section>
  {site.email ? <form class="enquiry-form" action={`mailto:${site.email}`} method="post" enctype="text/plain"><label>Your name<input required name="name" autocomplete="name" /></label><label>Email address<input required type="email" name="email" autocomplete="email" /></label><label>Organisation <span>Optional</span><input name="company" autocomplete="organization" /></label><label>What do you want to create?<select name="service"><option>Custom software</option><option>Web application</option><option>Mobile app</option><option>Desktop app</option><option>Website or e-commerce</option><option>AI or automation</option><option>Product discovery</option><option>Not sure yet</option></select></label><label class="full">Tell us about the idea or problem<textarea required name="message" rows="7" placeholder="What happens today, who needs something better, and what would success look like?"></textarea></label><p class="full form-privacy">Do not include confidential, personal or commercially sensitive material in an initial email. Your details are used to respond to this enquiry and discuss requested services. Read the <a href="/privacy/">privacy notice</a>.</p><button type="submit">Prepare project enquiry ↗</button><p>This opens your email app. The website does not store your message.</p></form> : <aside class="contact-pending"><span>// STUDIO ENQUIRIES OPENING SOON</span><h2>Shape the idea now.</h2><p>The verified public enquiry channel is not open yet. In the meantime, define the problem, the primary user, what happens today and the smallest useful outcome. Do not send confidential material through unverified channels.</p><a href="/process/">See how the studio works →</a></aside>}</main>
</SiteLayout>
